    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Wïyö lenchinö Parao kölö ECHOTYON, ‘Nya kïpa piköchan atökïpöghisyeghwanïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ato itaghenyi kïpa, otorchinan korengu mnyakaway. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyïghiti mnyakaway lalwa Nile ntökwitï kongu nko wölo irïwenyi nko pöröyengu nko kori mötworiku nko cho pö piköku nko nököghengu nko kariku cho ichïlisyeghonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komchininyi mnyakaway nko piköku nko mötworiku.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Lenchinö Aron, ghïtenö lïkïngu ompö paraku lalwatïn nko champilwonoy nko takaray, atökïpka mnyakaway koro Misri!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kughïtö Aron lïkïnyi ompö pögho Misri. Kïpka mnyakaway akulum koro Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kwigh chesoköytin lenyoni, kwipï mnyakaway koro Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkur Parao Musa nko Aron akïlenchï, “Asagha ECHOTYON kïchengenanïn nko piköchan mnyakawayichï. Atö opïstan pïchï kïpa kutö ECHOTYON amöros.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Musa Parao, “Ongörökan osowunyi nko mötworiku nko piköku, atökechengeninyi mnyakaway nko kongu kïpoto lalwa Nile onkït.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï Parao lö, “Soghwanïn asïyech.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Musa, “Nya kïlenyoni kemwaghanyi, atenkïtunö lö möminye chi nyo karkegh nko ECHOTYON Tororötïncha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïchengeninyi mnyakaway nko mötworiku nko piköku, kïpoto lalwa Nile onkït.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïweghö Musa nko Aron wölo mi Parao, atolapay kïsagh Musa ECHOTYON kïcheng mnyakaway, lenyini kakïchomnyechï nko Parao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh ECHOTYON lenyini kitep Musa. Kïmeghö mnyakawayichay kimi korïn nko kiroröy nko wölnö le paren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusupotö pipö Misri mnyakawayichay akutïkum. Kïngutö kore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini kisïwa Parao lö kimeghö mnyakaway, kwaghïghit mötïnyi amöterchïnye chane lenyini kimwa ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Mwochinö Aron kughïtö lïkïnyi akulï terïtyon kïlïkwï rïmpö ompö koro Misri kïmïkul.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh chane lenyoni. Kughïtö Aron lïkïnyi, akulï terïtyon kïlïkwï rïmpö ompö koro Misri kïmïkul. Kulum rïmpö pich nko tyonkïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumukyï chepsoköytin kwigh lenyoni akimemïcha. Wölo kilum rïmpö pich nko tyonkïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïlenchï chepsoköytinechay Parao, “Pö Tororöt owesyonï.” Kwaghïghit möt pö Parao amöterchïnye chane lenyini kimwa ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Inget asïyech tökwoghö aikany Parao ato wetöy nyinte lalwa aimwochï nyinte lö kölö ECHOTYON, ‘Nya kïpa piköchan, atökïpöghisyeghwanïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato mepïstenyinye chane kïpa, oyokunyi sosogh cho chang nko mötworiku nko piköku nko koriku. Nyïghiti sosogh kori pipö Misri nko ompö nyini le kore kïtangogh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo opïstenan koro Kosyen asisoni wölo möngöy piköchan, atömetïta sosogh wölini. Atenkïtunö lö ochan ECHOTYON nyo omitan nko pikachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona otönan rotyot kwenu piköchan nko cheku. Igho kiporunötonï asïyech.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh ECHOTYON lenyoni, kïpka sosogh cho chang kö pö Parao nko kori mötworichi nko koro Misri kïmïkul, kunyara kore ompö sosogh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
