              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlö Musa, “Melö karam keghacha lenyoni, ompöwölo kitönicha ECHOTYON Tororötïncha amöros nyo möchömöcha pipö Misri. Ato kitötecha amöros nyo melö chömöy chane, kïwirenecha koghïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
